## 3. Users and Entry Paths

| Role | What they want here | Entry method | Lands on |
|---|---|---|---|
| Patient | Get in without thinking | Tap "I am [Name]" card | `/patient` |
| Caregiver | Check on one family member | Mobile number plus 4-digit code | `/caregiver` |
| Healthcare Worker | Review many patients | Mobile number plus 4-digit code | `/clinician` |

**Patient design principle on this page:** if the device is known, the patient sees **one** large card with their photo and name and one button. Nothing else competes for attention.

