## 5. Hero Section Specification

### Content

| Element | Specification |
|---|---|
| Headline | "Stay sharp. Stay connected." Max 6 words, 40px bold (mobile 32px). |
| Supporting line | "Memory games, daily reminders and family messages, in your own language." One sentence. |
| Illustration | Warm flat illustration: an elderly person and a family member sharing tea, with a tea garden or river and hills behind. No photos of real patients. No clinical imagery such as brains or medical symbols. |
| Voice button | "Hear welcome" with speaker icon. Plays a short spoken greeting in the selected language. Shows captions while playing. |
| Trust line | "Works without internet. Your family's information stays private." |

### Visual rules
- Background `--bg` with a soft `--primary-tint` shape behind the illustration.
- Headline in `--primary-dark`, supporting line in `--text`.
- Text over illustration areas must meet contrast. Never place text directly on a busy image area.
- Motion: illustration fades in over 300ms. No parallax, looping, or autoplay animation.

